---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../../components/PageHero.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Compliance & disclosure"
  description="Driftstack's current compliance posture, vulnerability disclosure policy, sub-processor notice process, and audit-log retention."
>
  <PageHero label="Trust center · Compliance" title="Compliance posture & disclosure">
    <Breadcrumbs
      slot="crumbs"
      class="mb-5"
      items={[{ name: 'Home', href: '/' }, { name: 'Trust center', href: '/trust/' }, { name: 'Compliance' }]}
    />
    <p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-tk-ink-2">
      The controls and attestations available today, plus the private
      disclosure channel for security findings.
    </p>
  </PageHero>

  <section class="border-t border-tk-border bg-tk-surface">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 py-16">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-tk-ink">Certifications &amp; attestations</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 max-w-prose text-tk-ink-2">
        This table lists only attestations currently in place. Driftstack is
        not currently SOC 2 or ISO 27001 certified.
      </p>
      <table class="mt-8 w-full text-sm">
        <thead>
          <tr class="border-b border-tk-border text-left">
            <th class="py-2 pr-4 font-medium text-tk-ink">Standard</th>
            <th class="py-2 pr-4 font-medium text-tk-ink">Status</th>
            <th class="py-2 font-medium text-tk-ink">Evidence</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td class="py-3 pr-4 align-top">
              <span class="font-medium text-tk-ink">GDPR Article 28</span><br />
              <span class="text-xs text-tk-ink-3">DPA with SCCs available</span>
            </td>
            <td class="py-3 pr-4 align-top">
              <span class="inline-block rounded-full bg-emerald-50 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium text-emerald-700"
                >In place</span
              >
            </td>
            <td class="py-3 align-top text-tk-ink-2">
              <a href="/legal/dpa/" class="text-tk-accent-text underline">Data Processing Agreement</a>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-t border-tk-border bg-tk-surface/40">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 py-16">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-tk-ink">Vulnerability disclosure policy</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 max-w-prose text-tk-ink-2">
        Report security issues privately to
        <a href="mailto:security@driftstack.dev" class="text-tk-accent-text underline"
          >security@driftstack.dev</a
        >. If a report contains customer data or exploit material, use the
        initial email to arrange an encrypted transfer channel.
      </p>
      <dl class="mt-8 space-y-6">
        <div>
          <dt class="text-sm font-medium text-tk-ink">Response commitments</dt>
          <dd class="mt-1 text-sm text-tk-ink-2">
            <ul class="list-inside list-disc space-y-1">
              <li>Acknowledge receipt within 2 business days.</li>
              <li>Provide an initial severity assessment within 5 business days.</li>
              <li>Send status updates at least every 14 days until resolution.</li>
              <li>Credit the reporter publicly after remediation, with consent.</li>
            </ul>
          </dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt class="text-sm font-medium text-tk-ink">Safe harbour</dt>
          <dd class="mt-1 text-sm text-tk-ink-2">
            We will not pursue legal action against good-faith research on the
            public Driftstack surface when the researcher avoids customer data,
            service disruption, and public disclosure before remediation.
          </dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-t border-tk-border bg-tk-surface">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 py-16">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-tk-ink">Sub-processor change notice</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 max-w-prose text-tk-ink-2">
        Under GDPR Article 28(2) and Annex 3 of our DPA, we provide 30
        calendar days' notice for a material addition or replacement on the
        <a href="/trust/sub-processors/" class="text-tk-accent-text underline"
          >sub-processor list</a
        >. Customers can object during that window by emailing
        <a href="mailto:support@driftstack.dev" class="text-tk-accent-text underline"
          >support@driftstack.dev</a
        >.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-t border-tk-border bg-tk-surface/40">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 py-16">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-tk-ink">Audit-log retention</h2>
      <ul class="mt-4 max-w-prose list-inside list-disc space-y-2 text-tk-ink-2">
        <li>
          Customer audit logs follow the account tier's published retention and
          are available through the dashboard and
          <code class="font-mono">GET /v1/account/audit-log</code>.
        </li>
        <li>Privileged admin-action records are retained internally for 365 days.</li>
        <li>Access logs stay in quick-access storage for 90 days, then in archive for one year.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
